1
00:01:04,319 --> 00:01:05,519
Watch your step.

2
00:01:41,799 --> 00:01:42,400
Dongmei.

3
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:43,799
What brings you here?

4
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:45,799
Sis...

5
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,439
I got a divorce.

6
00:01:50,120 --> 00:01:50,879
Mom.

7
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,560
Mom.

8
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,560
Mom...

9
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:01,799
Mom, I won another award!

10
00:02:06,159 --> 00:02:06,959
Smile for me.

11
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:11,319
Mom, my teacher gave this to me.

12
00:02:11,319 --> 00:02:12,080
Here, you have it.

13
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,639
Okay.

14
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:44,680
You're out.

15
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,479
Mom.

16
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,039
Mom.

17
00:02:54,400 --> 00:02:55,439
I'm begging you, Shi Qing.

18
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:58,439
Can't you wait until he's a bit older?

19
00:02:58,479 --> 00:02:59,560
You promised!

20
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:01,639
Our son is mine.

21
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,800
Mom!

22
00:03:03,879 --> 00:03:04,240
Shitou!

23
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:05,960
I don't want to go with him.

24
00:03:06,080 --> 00:03:07,319
Shitou, don't be scared.

25
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,439
I don't want to go with him!

26
00:03:08,439 --> 00:03:09,439
He's your dad.

27
00:03:09,680 --> 00:03:10,960
I don't want to go.

28
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,120
Mom!

29
00:03:15,199 --> 00:03:15,719
Shitou!

30
00:03:16,599 --> 00:03:17,120
Shitou!

31
00:03:23,639 --> 00:03:24,960
Shitou!

32
00:03:43,680 --> 00:03:44,479
Village Chief.

33
00:03:45,479 --> 00:03:45,960
Dongmei.

34
00:03:46,039 --> 00:03:47,680
Come on in, have a seat.

35
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,199
Sit down, sit down.

36
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:50,919
Have some water.

37
00:03:52,319 --> 00:03:53,000
Village Chief...

38
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,199
I wanted to ask about Shitou.

39
00:03:55,719 --> 00:03:57,159
Is he doing all right with Shi Qing?

40
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:03,800
Dongmei,

41
00:04:05,800 --> 00:04:07,120
you two are divorced.

42
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,240
He has custody of the boy.

43
00:04:10,199 --> 00:04:12,120
A father wouldn't neglect his own child.

44
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:18,319
I just want to know if he's doing okay.

45
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,800
How should I put it...

46
00:04:26,399 --> 00:04:27,720
I didn't expect it either.

47
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,120
Shi Qing...

48
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:32,160
He's even more violent since getting out of prison.

49
00:04:35,279 --> 00:04:36,160
Little Shitou...

50
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:41,600
He builds fires, cooks, feeds pigs, and does laundry.

51
00:04:42,199 --> 00:04:45,120
A little boy treated just like a farmhand.

52
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:47,720
One winter,

53
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:50,079
just because he didn't start the fire right,

54
00:04:50,519 --> 00:04:53,360
he made him kneel on the ground all night long.

55
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,560
I went to talk some sense into him,

56
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:01,240
but he shoved me against the wall to beat me.

57
00:05:01,240 --> 00:05:03,959
He even cursed at me for meddling.

58
00:05:09,240 --> 00:05:10,360
It's all my fault.

59
00:05:13,279 --> 00:05:14,639
Back then, I talked you

60
00:05:15,759 --> 00:05:17,240
into letting him have the boy.

61
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:23,639
I let you down.

62
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,399
Go see for yourself.

63
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,800
What are you doing here?

64
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,120
I came to see Shitou.

65
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,519
Shitou? What about him?

66
00:05:42,519 --> 00:05:43,800
He's doing just fine with me.

67
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,839
I heard you beat him.

68
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,920
Who said I beat him?

69
00:05:50,199 --> 00:05:51,040
Even if I did,

70
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,480
what's wrong with your old man beating his son?

71
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,800
Then why won't you let him eat?

72
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,800
If he doesn't work,

73
00:05:54,800 --> 00:05:55,839
why should I feed him?

74
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:57,199
Let me tell you,

75
00:05:57,360 --> 00:05:58,160
if you want to eat,

76
00:05:58,160 --> 00:05:59,680
you've got to learn to starve first, understand?

77
00:06:00,879 --> 00:06:01,800
He's just a child!

78
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,079
He's still in school!

79
00:06:03,839 --> 00:06:05,480
Can't you use your brain for once?

80
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:05,959
School?

81
00:06:05,959 --> 00:06:08,040
Isn't school just to put food on the table?

82
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,120
What's your problem anyway?

83
00:06:11,800 --> 00:06:12,800
Feeling sorry for him?

84
00:06:12,920 --> 00:06:14,120
If you feel sorry for him, come back!

85
00:06:15,040 --> 00:06:15,839
What do you mean?

86
00:06:16,120 --> 00:06:17,360
You know what I mean.

87
00:06:17,720 --> 00:06:19,160
Weren't you so capable?

88
00:06:19,439 --> 00:06:20,560
Go find the village chief.

89
00:06:20,560 --> 00:06:21,360
We're getting remarried.

90
00:06:22,199 --> 00:06:23,920
Why would I ever remarry you?

91
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:25,839
Won't remarry me, huh?

92
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,920
You listen to me.

93
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,240
If you want your son, you have to remarry me.

94
00:06:30,839 --> 00:06:31,839
Trade yourself for him.

95
00:06:32,560 --> 00:06:33,839
What do you take him for?

96
00:06:33,839 --> 00:06:34,759
What do I take him for?

97
00:06:34,839 --> 00:06:36,519
A leash to drag you back.

98
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,199
I'll kill you!

99
00:06:47,439 --> 00:06:49,120
Dad, don't hit me!

100
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,639
Shitou!

101
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:50,959
Mom!

102
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:51,519
What happened, Shitou?

103
00:06:51,519 --> 00:06:52,879
Mom, Dad's trying to hit me!

104
00:06:52,879 --> 00:06:53,839
Where do you think you're running?

105
00:06:53,839 --> 00:06:55,439
Stop right there, both of you! Stop!

106
00:06:56,240 --> 00:06:57,040
Stop!

107
00:06:57,199 --> 00:06:58,600
Found your savior, have you?

108
00:06:58,879 --> 00:06:59,879
What are you doing?

109
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:01,360
What am I doing? If he doesn't work, I'll beat him!

110
00:07:01,360 --> 00:07:02,360
I'll beat you to death!

111
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:03,399
Stop hitting him!

112
00:07:05,240 --> 00:07:06,040
What?

113
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,439
Want to take our son away?

114
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,879
Don't you forget,

115
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:14,560
the court awarded me custody of our son!

116
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:19,600
Look here!

117
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,439
Folks!

118
00:07:20,959 --> 00:07:21,519
Look at this!

119
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:25,360
If she wants to take my son, the condition is

120
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:29,480
she must personally beg me

121
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,480
to let her come back to my house!

122
00:07:30,680 --> 00:07:31,600
Did you hear that?

123
00:07:37,439 --> 00:07:39,279
Don't forget my conditions!

124
00:07:39,560 --> 00:07:40,040
Think about it.

125
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,000
Think it over.

126
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,600
I agree.

127
00:07:57,120 --> 00:07:57,600
What?

128
00:08:02,279 --> 00:08:03,319
I agree.

129
00:08:06,079 --> 00:08:07,160
Did everyone hear that?

130
00:08:07,839 --> 00:08:09,399
She just said she's willing!

131
00:08:09,399 --> 00:08:10,279
I didn't say it.

132
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,160
She said it herself!

133
00:08:15,160 --> 00:08:18,519
So you agree to remarry me?

134
00:08:20,560 --> 00:08:21,920
See? Problem solved!

135
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:22,959
What's the big deal?

136
00:08:24,160 --> 00:08:24,959
Old Li!

137
00:08:25,720 --> 00:08:26,519
Village Chief!

138
00:08:27,319 --> 00:08:29,040
You listen to me.

139
00:08:29,519 --> 00:08:32,159
You're the one who has to handle our remarriage too!

140
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,399
Village Chief!

141
00:08:38,919 --> 00:08:39,799
You brat.

142
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:45,080
All right, break it up, everyone.

143
00:08:47,759 --> 00:08:48,519
Shitou.

144
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,879
Are you all right?

145
00:08:49,879 --> 00:08:50,519
Auntie.

146
00:08:50,519 --> 00:08:51,320
Go make dinner.

147
00:08:54,759 --> 00:08:56,279
I'm talking to you!

148
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,679
Say something!

149
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,279
Still defying me?

150
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,559
I'll beat you to death, you hear me?

151
00:09:01,879 --> 00:09:03,039
Screw you!

152
00:09:03,320 --> 00:09:04,279
Don't hit my mom!

153
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,960
Or I'll call the police!

154
00:09:05,960 --> 00:09:07,519
You little bastard!

155
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:09,919
Shi Qing!

156
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:12,799
What?

157
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,559
If you touch my son one more time,

158
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,399
I'll fight you to the death!

159
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:26,159
Are you okay?

160
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,399
Let me see where it hurts.

161
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:30,799
Mom.

162
00:09:30,799 --> 00:09:31,279
Where are you hurt?

163
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,159
I'm fine.

164
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,200
Eat some meat.

165
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:43,200
Mom.

166
00:09:44,039 --> 00:09:45,360
I want to grow up fast.

167
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,159
I'm going to study law.

168
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,759
I'm going to have him locked up,

169
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,120
and never let him out.

170
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,519
Okay.

171
00:09:52,759 --> 00:09:53,799
You just grow up well,

172
00:09:54,360 --> 00:09:55,600
and Mom will live a good life with you.

173
00:09:57,440 --> 00:09:58,559
I keep dreaming.

174
00:10:00,519 --> 00:10:02,440
I dream that he buries you in the dirt.

175
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:06,559
Don't think like that.

176
00:10:07,279 --> 00:10:09,240
Here, eat all the meat.

177
00:10:10,600 --> 00:10:11,440
There's more meat.

178
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,039
Here.

179
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,600
Look, here comes the bride!

180
00:10:52,399 --> 00:10:53,200
So beautiful!

181
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,080
Bow to the ancestors.

182
00:11:01,679 --> 00:11:03,279
First kowtow.

183
00:11:05,919 --> 00:11:07,519
Second kowtow.

184
00:11:10,120 --> 00:11:11,679
Third kowtow.

185
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,399
Rise.

186
00:11:16,720 --> 00:11:20,320
Present wine and tea to the parents.

187
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,919
Dad, please have some tea.

188
00:11:25,679 --> 00:11:27,519
Louder!

189
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:29,240
Dad, please have some tea!

190
00:11:29,440 --> 00:11:30,240
Drink it!

191
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:37,919
Red envelope, red envelope!

192
00:11:37,919 --> 00:11:39,240
Dad, give her the red envelope!

193
00:11:39,240 --> 00:11:40,039
Give her the red envelope.

194
00:11:40,200 --> 00:11:41,360
The bride departs!

195
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,440
Set off the firecrackers!

196
00:11:54,960 --> 00:11:55,759
Mom,

197
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,440
growing up,

198
00:11:57,440 --> 00:11:59,279
I was always such a handful.

199
00:11:59,799 --> 00:12:00,840
All these years,

200
00:12:01,279 --> 00:12:02,519
you've worked so hard.

201
00:12:03,159 --> 00:12:04,879
But I'm all grown up now.

202
00:12:05,559 --> 00:12:06,919
I'm capable enough

203
00:12:06,919 --> 00:12:08,320
to take care of myself.

204
00:12:09,559 --> 00:12:11,799
You don't need to worry about me anymore.

205
00:12:12,159 --> 00:12:13,000
Listen to me.

206
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,320
Take care of yourself.

207
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,440
I will, Mom.

208
00:12:16,639 --> 00:12:18,360
I'll come visit you often.

209
00:12:18,879 --> 00:12:20,519
Take care of yourself too.

210
00:12:21,879 --> 00:12:23,039
I'll be going now.

211
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:29,000
Mom, I'm leaving.

212
00:12:34,519 --> 00:12:35,159
Dongmei,

213
00:12:37,279 --> 00:12:38,799
both your girls are married off now.

214
00:12:41,960 --> 00:12:42,960
All these years,

215
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:45,799
it hasn't been easy for you.

216
00:13:03,720 --> 00:13:04,519
Yang Dongmei!

217
00:13:05,799 --> 00:13:06,600
Yang Dongmei!

218
00:13:08,639 --> 00:13:09,440
Yang Dongmei!

219
00:13:19,399 --> 00:13:20,200
Give me money!

220
00:13:21,080 --> 00:13:23,960
Your old man's flat broke right now!

221
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:27,840
Don't you have land?

222
00:13:28,240 --> 00:13:29,600
Don't you have a house?

223
00:13:29,759 --> 00:13:31,600
Sell them and get your old man the cash!

224
00:13:32,639 --> 00:13:33,320
I don't have any.

225
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:36,200
What?

226
00:13:38,559 --> 00:13:39,399
I don't have any.

227
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:45,200
Where did you hide the money?

228
00:13:45,639 --> 00:13:47,879
Are you keeping someone on the side?

229
00:13:48,559 --> 00:13:49,639
I knew it!

230
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,240
You little slut...

231
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:52,279
Don't you curse at my mom!

232
00:13:52,679 --> 00:13:53,480
Don't provoke him!

233
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,559
Little bastard!

234
00:13:54,559 --> 00:13:55,600
I'll kill you!

235
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,399
Village Chief!

236
00:13:56,480 --> 00:13:57,080
Village Chief!

237
00:13:59,159 --> 00:13:59,960
Run!

238
00:14:02,080 --> 00:14:02,960
Stop right there!

239
00:14:08,080 --> 00:14:08,919
Stop!

240
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:16,320
Shitou, quick! Go home, Shitou!

241
00:14:19,399 --> 00:14:20,200
Get inside, quick!

242
00:14:23,519 --> 00:14:24,360
Get over here!

243
00:14:28,039 --> 00:14:28,840
Shitou!

244
00:14:29,320 --> 00:14:30,120
Shitou!

245
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,039
Drop it!

246
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:38,519
Go get a rope!

247
00:14:38,720 --> 00:14:39,720
Tie him up!

248
00:14:39,879 --> 00:14:41,000
The rope, quick!

249
00:15:02,559 --> 00:15:04,759
Shitou, come with Mom.

250
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,879
I'll kill you!

251
00:15:37,759 --> 00:15:39,240
I'll kill you!

252
00:15:40,840 --> 00:15:42,600
We can't keep him tied up forever.

253
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:47,279
Let's call the police.

254
00:16:20,759 --> 00:16:21,559
Mom!

255
00:16:22,200 --> 00:16:23,000
Mom!

256
00:16:23,159 --> 00:16:23,759
Run!

257
00:16:28,399 --> 00:16:29,000
Shitou!

258
00:17:43,440 --> 00:17:45,240
Even if I die ten times over,

259
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:48,319
I'll still kill you.
